{"meta":{"id":"tt38049145","type":"series","name":"Goodbye, Lara","imdb_id":"tt38049145","description":"Hace mucho tiempo, una princesa sirena llamada Lara se enamoró de un príncipe humano. Para estar con él, usó la poción de una bruja y se convirtió en humana, pero la magia tenía un precio: si no encontraba el amor verdadero, se desvanecería para siempre en espuma de mar. Ahora, 200 años después, Lara despierta en el lago Biwa con una última oportunidad de vivir y amar.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt38049145.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ZiCNiuOiUGfAF0j73RI8DX1Z1N.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n2hpBQQaOckGzOGf78YA0UiJWkZ.png","genres":["Animación","Drama","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-07-06T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","runtime":"24 min","imdbRating":"7.6","country":"Japan","cast":["菱川花菜","川石奈奈","Rika Fukami","Ayumu Murase","Tomohiro Oono","Mitsuaki Madono","Nanae Sumitomo","Masaki Terasoma","Minami Tsuda","Kazutomi Yamamoto","Honoka Inoue"],"writer":["川原杏奈","森山菜月"],"trailers":[{"source":"iPEeNBtnIOY","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"iPEeNBtnIOY","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"iPEeNBtnIOY","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.6","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt38049145"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Animaci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Sci-Fi+%26+Fantasy"},{"name":"菱川花菜","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%E8%8F%B1%E5%B7%9D%E8%8A%B1%E8%8F%9C"},{"name":"川石奈奈","category":"Cast","url"